KONTAKT
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hr">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>LEGO – Kontakt</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <div class="banner">
        <img src="lego_banner.jpg" alt="Lego banner">
    </div>
    <nav class="main-nav">
        <ul>
            <li><a href="index.html">Početna</a></li>
            <li><a href="kontakt.html">Kontakt</a></li>
            <li><a href="galerija.html">Galerija</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.lego.com" target="_blank">LEGO službena stranica</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>
</header>

<main>
    <section class="lego-contact">
        <h2>Kontaktirajte nas – LEGO podrška</h2>
        <p>Ako imate pitanje o svom LEGO setu, ispunite kontakt obrazac u nastavku.</p>

        <form class="lego-form" action="#" method="post">

            <div class="form-row">
                <label for="first-name">Ime *</label>
                <input type="text" id="first-name" name="first-name" placeholder="Vaše ime..." required>
            </div>

            <div class="form-row">
                <label for="last-name">Prezime *</label>
                <input type="text" id="last-name" name="last-name" placeholder="Vaše prezime..." required>
            </div>

            <div class="form-row">
                <label for="email">Vaš e-mail *</label>
                <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="Vaš e-mail..." required>
            </div>

            <div class="form-row">
                <label for="country">Država</label>
                <select id="country" name="country">
                    <option value="hrvatska">Hrvatska</option>
                    <option value="slovenija">Slovenija</option>
                    <option value="drugo">Drugo</option>
                </select>
            </div>

            <div class="form-row">
                <label for="subject">Poruka</label>
                <textarea id="subject" name="subject" rows="5" placeholder="Napišite svoju poruku..."></textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="form-row">
                <p><strong>Newsletter</strong></p>
                <div class="option">
                    <input type="checkbox" id="newsletter" name="newsletter">
                    <label for="newsletter">Želim primati LEGO novosti i popuste</label>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-row">
                <p><strong>Način dostave</strong></p>
                <div class="option">
                    <input type="radio" id="delivery-standard" name="delivery" value="standardna" checked>
                    <label for="delivery-standard">Standardna dostava</label>
                </div>

                <div class="option">
                    <input type="radio" id="delivery-express" name="delivery" value="ekspresna">
                    <label for="delivery-express">Ekspresna dostava</label>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-row">
                <label for="promo-code">Promo kod (onemogućeno polje)</label>
                <input type="text" id="promo-code" name="promo-code" value="USKORO" disabled>
            </div>

            <div class="form-row">
                <button type="submit" class="btn-send">Pošalji</button>
            </div>

        </form>
    </section>
</main>

<footer>
    &copy; LEGO klub – Kontakt stranica
</footer>

</body>
</html>









STYLE
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
}

body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background-color: #f0f0f0;
}

header {
    background-color: white;
    border: 1px solid #cccccc;
    margin: 20px;
    padding: 10px;
}

.banner img {
    width: 100%;
    display: block;
    border-bottom: 3px solid #ffcc00;
}

nav {
    background-color: #333333;
    padding: 8px;
    margin-top: 10px;
}

ul {
    list-style-type: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    text-align: center;
}

li {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-right: 15px;
}

a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: white;
    border: 1px solid white;
    padding: 5px 12px;
    font-size: 14px;
}

main {
    background-color: white;
    border: 1px solid #cccccc;
    margin: 0 20px 20px 20px;
    padding: 10px;
}

main h1 {
    text-align: center;
    color: blue;
    margin-top: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 28px;
}

main h2 {
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: #333333;
    font-size: 20px;
}

main p {
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 16px;
}

.uvod {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

#osnovan {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #cccccc;
    padding: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.vazno {
    color: green;
    font-weight: bold;
}

.lego-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 1px solid blue;
    padding: 5px 10px;
    color: blue;
    background-color: #ffffff;
}

.lego-slika {
    width: 300px;
    border: 1px solid #cccccc;
    margin-top: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.lista-tema {
    margin-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    list-style-type: square;
}

.napomena {
    color: red;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-top: 10px;
}

.raspored {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 10px;
}

.raspored caption {
    margin-bottom: 5px;
    font-weight: bold;
}

.raspored th,
.raspored td {
    border: 1px solid #cccccc;
    padding: 6px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 14px;
}

.raspored th {
    background-color: #fff7cc;
}

footer {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #555555;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.lego-contact {
    background-color: #fafafa;
    padding: 20px;
    margin: 20px;
    border: 1px solid #cccccc;
    border-radius: 5px;
}

.lego-form .form-row {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.lego-form label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
    font-weight: 600;
}

.lego-form input,
.lego-form select,
.lego-form textarea {
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid #cccccc;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font: inherit;
}

.lego-form input:focus,
.lego-form select:focus,
.lego-form textarea:focus {
    border-color: #007bff;
    background-color: #eef6ff;
    outline: none;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.25);
}

.lego-form input[type="checkbox"]:checked + label,
.lego-form input[type="radio"]:checked + label {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1a7f1a;
}

.lego-form input:disabled {
    background-color: #eeeeee;
    color: #666666;
    cursor: not-allowed;
}

.lego-form input:enabled,
.lego-form select:enabled,
.lego-form textarea:enabled {
    background-color: #ffffff;
}

.btn-send {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background-color: #28a745;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
}

.btn-send:hover {
    background-color: #218838;
}

nav.main-nav a {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    background-color: #333333;
    color: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: all 0.2s ease-in-out;
}

nav.main-nav a:hover {
    background-color: #555555;
}

nav.main-nav a:focus {
    background-color: #555555;
    outline: 2px solid #ffffff;
}

nav.main-nav a:active {
    transform: scale(0.97);
}

nav.main-nav a:visited {
    color: #dddddd;
}

nav.main-nav a[href*="galerija"] {
    background-color: #ffcc00;
    color: #333333;
    font-weight: bold;
}

nav.main-nav a[target="_blank"] {
    background-color: #0066cc;
}

nav.main-nav a[target="_blank"]::after {
    content: " ↗";
    font-size: 0.9em;
}

.lego-gallery {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 2rem auto;
}

.gallery-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
}

.lego-gallery img {
    width: calc(33.333% - 0.66rem);
    transition: all 0.25s ease-in-out;
}

.lego-gallery img[data-set="city"] {
    border: 4px solid blue;
}

.lego-gallery img[data-set="technic"] {
    border: 4px solid orange;
}

.lego-gallery img[data-set="friends"] {
    border: 4px solid deeppink;
}

.lego-gallery img[src$=".jpg"] {
    border-radius: 8px;
}

.lego-gallery img:hover {
    transform: scale(1.03);
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    cursor: pointer;
}

